# ---- Maven / Java ----
# Build output
**/target/
**/out/

# Package files / compiled classes
*.class
*.jar
*.war
*.ear
*.nar
*.zip
*.tar.gz
*.rar

# Maven wrapper (keep the scripts, ignore cache/dir artifacts)
.mvn/wrapper/
!mvnw
!mvnw.cmd

# Test reports and coverage
**/target/surefire-reports/
**/target/failsafe-reports/
**/target/site/
**/target/jacoco.exec
**/jacoco.exec

# Logs
*.log

# JVM crash logs
hs_err_pid*
replay_pid*

# ---- IDEs ----
# IntelliJ IDEA / JetBrains
.idea/
*.iml
*.iws
*.ipr

# Eclipse
.project
.classpath
.settings/
.factorypath

# VS Code
.vscode/

# ---- OS files ----
# macOS
.DS_Store
.AppleDouble
.LSOverride

# Windows
Thumbs.db
Thumbs.db:encryptable
Desktop.ini
$RECYCLE.BIN/

# ---- Misc ----
# Local environment / secrets (none expected, but future-proof)
*.env
.env.*

# Temporary files
*.swp
*.swo
*~
*.tmp
~$*

# Generated by tools
/.idea_modules/
/.metadata/

## AI Coding Assistants ###
## CLAUDE.md and .claude/ are tracked. The hooks and the skill in there are part of how this
## repository is worked on, they run only inside an assistant session, and .claude/README.md
## says what they do and whom they bind — which is nobody who does not use one.
## Three things stay out, all machine-local rather than project configuration:
.claude/settings.local.json
.claude/CLAUDE.md
.claude/skills/graphify/
## Machine-local MCP endpoints (an IDE's port on 127.0.0.1), not project configuration.
.mcp.json

## Working notes — direction, open-finding registers, generated reports.
## Addressed to the maintainer, not to the public; see working/README.md.
working/

## Graphify
graphify-out/
